  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, UNICEF will support social welfare system reform through introducing a new child protection body, which will have the responsibility and capacity to provide assistance and a range of community services to children and families. All project activities will build on lessons learned and progress achieved in previous or ongoing UNICEF projects.</narrative>
